*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.log
*.recipe
*.vcxproj.FileListAbsolute.txt
*.nativecodeanalysis.sarif
UpgradeLog.htm

# Visual Studio and Xcode per-user files. The few still tracked hold debugger
